The original Tiny Manas model code, documentation, model weights, technical
paper, and tokenizer artifact are published for research transparency and
public inspection. Unless the copyright holder grants separate written
permission, no license is granted to copy, modify, redistribute, sublicense,
or sell those original materials.

The Manas-UdS corpus text used to train the accepted model is not included in
this repository. That source corpus is licensed under Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

The tokenizer was originally released at:
https://github.com/nik1t7n/kyrgyz-tokenizer

Third-party dependencies and referenced works remain subject to their own
licenses and terms. Publishing the model does not relicense the source corpus,
dependencies, or referenced materials, and it does not remove any upstream
attribution, non-commercial, or share-alike requirements.
